#. postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.source
#: src/data/post.js:23
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.source"
msgid "Admissions · Joint Faculty Review"
msgstr "入試課・教員合同審査"

#. postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.subject
#: src/data/post.js:27
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.subject"
msgid "Conditional offer (awaiting your application)"
msgstr "条件付合格通知（願書到着待ち）"

#. postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.body
#: src/data/post.js:28
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.body"
msgid ""
"The faculty has already read a study plan you have not submitted. File the "
"original within seven days; if they differ, the more interesting traceable "
"version prevails."
msgstr "教員会は、まだ提出されていない学修計画を先に読了しました。七日以内に原本を提出してください。内容が異なる場合は、より面白く追跡可能な版を採用します。"

#. postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.correction
#: src/data/post.js:31
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.admission-before-application.correction"
msgid "v1 placed “conditional” on the back; v2 restores it to the subject."
msgstr "v1 は「条件付」を封筒裏へ配置。v2 で件名へ戻しました。"

#. postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.source
#: src/data/post.js:37
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.source"
msgid "Boundary Hall Exams Desk"
msgstr "境界講堂試験机"

#. postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.subject
#: src/data/post.js:41
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.subject"
msgid "Make-up cancelled — it concluded yesterday"
msgstr "追試取消通知——追試は昨日終了"

#. postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.body
#: src/data/post.js:42
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.body"
msgid ""
"This notice cancels yesterday’s 15:00 make-up. Those who finished need not "
"answer backwards; others may apply for the Not-Yet-Happened room."
msgstr "本通知は昨日15時の追試を取消します。受験済みの者は逆向きに解答しなくてよく、未受験者は「未発生」試験室を申請できます。"

#. postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.correction
#: src/data/post.js:45
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.cancel-after-makeup.correction"
msgid "Aya's extra printed “cancel” as “cover”; Exams refuses to treat them as the same verb."
msgstr "文の号外は「取消」を「取材」と印刷。試験机は同じ動詞と認めない。"

#. postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.source
#: src/data/post.js:51
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.source"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Campus Extra"
msgstr "文々。学内号外"

#. postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.subject
#: src/data/post.js:55
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.subject"
msgid "Exclusive: next paragraph denies this headline"
msgstr "独占：本状次段で件名を否認"

#. postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.body
#: src/data/post.js:56
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.body"
msgid ""
"A reliable source (the reporter) says the university will issue a notice in "
"nine minutes denying this paper knew it early. Read tomorrow's correction "
"first."
msgstr "信頼できる情報源（記者本人）によれば、大学は九分後、本紙の事前入手を認めない通知を出します。全文は明日の訂正版を先にご覧ください。"

#. postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.correction
#: src/data/post.js:59
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.aya-extra-previews-letter.correction"
msgid "v4 said “unanimous”; v5 adds a tiny asterisk beside three objections."
msgstr "v4 は「全学一致」。v5 は三席異議の横へ極小の星印を追加。"

#. postSeedMessages.library-read-aloud.source
#: src/data/post.js:65
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.library-read-aloud.source"
msgid "Misty Lake Library North Wing"
msgstr "霧の湖図書館北翼"

#. postSeedMessages.library-read-aloud.subject
#: src/data/post.js:69
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.library-read-aloud.subject"
msgid "Due notice: “read” does not mean read the whole letter aloud"
msgstr "返却期限：『既読』を全文朗読と解釈しないでください"

#. postSeedMessages.library-read-aloud.body
#: src/data/post.js:70
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.library-read-aloud.body"
msgid ""
"A fairy courier read seven private recall letters aloud in the reading room. "
"Henceforth “read” means opened; singing remains public performance."
msgstr "妖精配達員が閲覧室で私信の督促状七通を朗読しました。今後「既読」は開封のみを意味し、歌唱は公開演奏です。"

#. postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.source
#: src/data/post.js:79
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.source"
msgid "Eientei University Hospital"
msgstr "永遠亭附属校医院"

#. postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.subject
#: src/data/post.js:83
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.subject"
msgid "Full-moon dose correction: use the moon’s arrival"
msgstr "満月服薬時刻訂正：月の到着を基準"

#. postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.body
#: src/data/post.js:84
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.body"
msgid ""
"Campus bells differ from lunar time by twelve minutes. “After full moon” "
"means when the moon clears bamboo, not Bunbunmaru publication time."
msgstr "校鐘と月面時刻は十二分差です。「満月後」の処方は月が竹梢を越えた時点から算定し、文々。号外の発行時刻は用いません。"

#. postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.correction
#: src/data/post.js:87
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.clinic-moon-dose.correction"
msgid "v3 used campus bells; v4 uses lunar time. Do not return already swallowed medicine."
msgstr "v3 は校鐘基準。v4 は月面基準へ。服薬済みでも薬を戻す必要なし。"

#. postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.source
#: src/data/post.js:93
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.source"
msgid "Residence Night Desk"
msgstr "学生寮夜間当番机"

#. postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.subject
#: src/data/post.js:97
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.subject"
msgid "Room transfer paused: the room filed to change its resident first"
msgstr "転室申請停止：部屋が先に居住者変更を申請"

#. postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.body
#: src/data/post.js:98
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.body"
msgid ""
"West Wing W-09's latch walked to Property Arbitration. The room rejects a "
"new resident without it; the latch says the room never closed properly."
msgstr "西翼 W-09 の窓留めが自ら物権仲裁所へ移動。部屋は窓留めなしで新居住者を受け入れられず、窓留めは部屋が一度も正しく閉じなかったと主張。"

#. postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.correction
#: src/data/post.js:101
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.housing-window-claim.correction"
msgid "The draft named W-06; W-06 wants it retained because it also wants a new resident."
msgstr "原稿は W-06。W-06 は自分も居住者変更を望むため保存を要求。"

#. postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.source
#: src/data/post.js:107
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.source"
msgid "Boundary Festival Six-Desk Notice"
msgstr "境界開学祭六机連署"

#. postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.subject
#: src/data/post.js:111
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.subject"
msgid "Sole Main Gate notice (three gates attached)"
msgstr "唯一正門通知（附属三扉）"

#. postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.body
#: src/data/post.js:112
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.body"
msgid ""
"Hakurei Gate, Myouren Reception Gate, and Moriya Windway may all display "
"“Sole Main Gate”. Choose by flight ability, faith, and fear of hills."
msgstr "博麗門、命蓮寺受付門、守矢風路はいずれも「唯一正門」表示を許可。飛べない、信仰所属、山登りへの恐怖により選択してください。"

#. postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.correction
#: src/data/post.js:115
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.festival-gate-three.correction"
msgid "v5 had two gates; Yukari drew a boundary between versions."
msgstr "v5 は二扉のみ。紫が二版の間へ境界を描いた。"

#. postSeedMessages.object-delivered-itself.source
#: src/data/post.js:121
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.object-delivered-itself.source"
msgid "An envelope with no sender"
msgstr "差出人のない封筒"

#. postSeedMessages.object-delivered-itself.subject
#: src/data/post.js:125
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.object-delivered-itself.subject"
msgid "Lost Property Office missing notice"
msgstr "遺失物取扱所の紛失通知"

#. postSeedMessages.object-delivered-itself.body
#: src/data/post.js:126
msgctxt "text:postSeedMessages.object-delivered-itself.body"
msgid ""
"This envelope accuses Lost Property of losing itself in the organisation "
"chart. Deliver this if found; the office will certify that you found "
"yourself too."
msgstr "本封筒は、遺失物取扱所が学務組織図で自らを紛失したと告発します。同所を見つけたら本状を渡してください。あなた自身も見つかったと証明します。"

#. postDeliveryChannels.tengu-express.name
#: src/data/post.js:138
msgctxt "text:postDeliveryChannels.tengu-express.name"
msgid "Crow-Tengu Express"
msgstr "鴉天狗速達"

#. postDeliveryChannels.tengu-express.speed
#: src/data/post.js:139
msgctxt "text:postDeliveryChannels.tengu-express.speed"
msgid "Fastest; may precede its contents"
msgstr "最速。内容そのものより早い場合あり"

#. postDeliveryChannels.fairy-rounds.name
#: src/data/post.js:144
msgctxt "text:postDeliveryChannels.fairy-rounds.name"
msgid "Fairy Campus Rounds"
msgstr "妖精学内巡回"

#. postDeliveryChannels.fairy-rounds.speed
#: src/data/post.js:145
msgctxt "text:postDeliveryChannels.fairy-rounds.speed"
msgid "Delivers to the most interesting recipient"
msgstr "最も面白い受取人へ配達"

#. postDeliveryChannels.wooden-board.name
#: src/data/post.js:150
msgctxt "text:postDeliveryChannels.wooden-board.name"
msgid "Wooden-board posting"
msgstr "木札掲示"

#. postDeliveryChannels.wooden-board.speed
#: src/data/post.js:151
msgctxt "text:postDeliveryChannels.wooden-board.speed"
msgid "Slowest; credibility wrinkles after rain"
msgstr "最遅。雨後は信頼度が皺になる"
